    {
      "annotation_id": "c01cc4fdca1c4a60ab9f4aa81bbb5572_122",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The respondents not furnished any materials to rebut or disprove the entries in the Aadhar card related to age of petitioner and not furnished any satisfactory materials in order to disprove the age of petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "dd0d4755dd0147e8af517bfe408499fb_123",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the document furnished by petitioner, his age is 48 years as on the date of accident and same is taken into consideration for applying multiplier."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e07f693b296e4c4582b4eda79396ae5a_124",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the ratio laid in Smt.Sarla Verma case the applicable multiplier is '13'."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b562ac0ed4774a08bfc7737928381763_125",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per ratio laid down by Hon'ble supreme court in Raj Kumar V/s. Ajay kumar and another, this tribunal not deducted personal expenses of petitioner out of his gross income."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "481a64a1f787497cb185adb5bc5159ae_126",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, future earning capacity of the petitioner due to permanent disability works out as under :\nAnnual Income before accident : (.16,000/- x 12) = .1,92,000/-\nLoss of future earning p.a. (10% of prior annual income) = .19,200/-.\nMultiplie"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2a949b728af5483a9695a8f354a2f3bc_127",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The doctor has opined that the petitioner sustained grievous injuries and he is unable to do his day- today activities as earlier."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "05f71c2c265d44b681e46a5a9ce6b31d_128",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The doctor, who examined the petitioner, not stated that the petitioner is unable to do his daily work."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "89e5ec42f2714a83b85fac65b3e2d48b_129",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "By considering the facts and circumstances of the case, the tribunal is of the view that compensation of .10,000/- appears just and reasonable under the head deprivation of future amenities."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7f9d4edafedb4eee901ba44811afb681_130",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "14. Therefore, the petitioner is entitled for compensation as follows:\n Sl"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0bfa2b0a8ba24b38b86371247886d0a0_131",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": ". No ."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "adc255e7cf6f4f66850740cdf1ae2405_133",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "d. Towards conveyance .10,000/-\n e. Towards loss of income .32,000/-\n during treatment  f. Towards loss of future .2,49,600/-\n earning  g. Deprivation of future .10,000/-\n amenities  "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "13361c2b7d334e3fb96ae1ff4520957c_134",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Total compensation .7,88,659/-\nThe petitioner is entitled for total compensation of .7,88,659/-.\n15."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "025c52724e4441cdb1486b5ab7a4502b_135",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In MFA.No.100090 of 2014 C/w. MFA.No.25107 of 2013 between Vijay Ishwar Jadhav and others Vs. Ulrich Belchior Fernandes and another, the Hon'ble High Court of Karnataka at Page No.7 at Para No.15 held as follows:\n\"However, the provisions of"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "71ee5bacae35452a97fb67f26268a139_136",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, in the absence of any other law relating to interest on Judgments, the MACT has to follow the provisions of Section 34 of CPC, 1908."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "39863687464741faadb332736da1fb3e_137",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Thus, in the given circumstances of this case,\ninterest at the rate of more than 6% could not have been awarded.\""
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5f87a08c0b154f539065fd32b7bdeffb_138",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nIn view of ratio and dictum laid down by the Hon'ble High Court of Karnataka in the above judgment, the petitioner is entitled for interest @ 6% per annum from the date of petition till its realization."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7023e9e03493459ba015f3c9d594a5a8_139",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "16. The petitioner has filed petition against the respondents No.1 and 2."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "af9a92b98a564ecb861e42da62fbeff4_140",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is already held that the accident occurred due to rash and negligent driving of Canter bearing Regn.No.KA-37-A-8542 by its driver."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a437fd39925846178561506bd9ae2c42_141",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "So, the respondent No.1 & 2 being the insurer and owner of the offending vehicle are jointly and severally liable to pay compensation to the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2f02606787e34026aae4c783ea6850c6_142",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, Issue No.2 answered Partly in the Affirmative."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f95c5a76c96f4736b5df99abe0e9caa3_143",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n17. Issue No.3:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "61b970056ad040a88e7d75df47e611c3_144",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In view of the findings given on the above said issues, this Tribunal proceeds to pass the following:\nO R D E R"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7d3acfac3e6546d5a5a4d4a67db30563_145",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The claim petition filed by the petitioner Under Section 166 of Motor Vehicles Act is hereby partly allowed with cost."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fe837bcfefee43fd88d0512abf6abb1e_146",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThe petitioner is entitled for compensation amount of .7,88,659/- (Rupees Seven Lakhs Eighty Eight Thousand Six Hundred and Fifty Nine only) with interest at 6%\np.a., from the date of petition till realization."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6d862e8f7b37469ca31292a42c4d39c5_147",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nShivananjegowda vs Hdfc Ergo General Ins Co Ltd on 28 October, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/126342402/\n8"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2a6b65854b034b5da4df98d3ad7ba6f7_148",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Respondent No.1 & 2 are jointly and severally liable to pay compensation to petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d42dc9597a504f1ca09f722a054727f9_149",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Respondent No.1 being the insurer is primarily liable to deposit the said compensation amount within a period of two months from the date of award."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "495df734cc994272b5506d6c9853e9e9_150",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nIn the event of deposit of the said compensation amount, 40% shall be deposited in the name of petitioner for a period of 3 years in any nationalized bank or scheduled bank and the remaining 60% shall be released in favour of petitioner on"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e42b80a946d84f49b71426954d395e6d_151",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nAfter deposit of compensation amount with interest thereon disburse amount as mentioned above as per guidelines laid down by Hon'ble High Court in MFA.No.2509/2019 (ECA) and as per General Circular No.2/2019 dated 19.8.2019."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f48e5d982dc647fc9337f4f8bc9f1193_152",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThe petitioner hereby directed to produce particulars of his Bank Account, with name of Bank, IFSC Code, Account Number with copy of First Page of Bank Pass Book which contained compulsorily photographs of petitioner, which is duly atteste"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1b0b67f592a240bbbdbdd59e8faef993_153",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further petitioner shall produce PAN Card/Aadhaar Card."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a14b3393dca141e18a10f5c4fd484826_154",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nIn case of deposit of awarded amount with interest thereon by respondent, the petitioner is entitled to receive amount as mentioned above after expiry of period provided for filing an appeal."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e36cfe26afbc4e948cf183cddabc090f_155",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nBank shall not advance loan on such FD, and shall not cause premature release of FD without permission from the Tribunal."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "42e4991f881a4e56b8c00f054ba78095_156",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nBank shall release amount along with interest thereon in favour of petitioner on proper verification and identification or credit said amount to his account after expiry of three years period of deposit,\nwithout waiting for further order o"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "096b78ea41b342a596daa9a5ff3b8d59_157",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Advocate fee is fixed at .1,000/-."
